---
---

<section class="section bg-canvas-soft border-b-0 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px"
    style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(45,212,191,0.4), transparent);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div
    class="absolute -bottom-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[720px] h-[720px] rounded-full pointer-events-none blur-[40px]"
    style="background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(45,212,191,0.10) 0%, rgba(45,212,191,0) 60%);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="shell relative text-center max-w-[720px]">
    <p
      class="text-ink-strong font-normal tracking-tight m-0"
      style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;"
    >
      바이브코딩의 시작은<br />
      <em class="not-italic text-primary-soft">‘탄탄한 기획’</em>입니다.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-body text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Vooster와 함께 제대로 된 개발을 시작해보세요.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
      <button type="button" class="btn-primary" data-onboarding-cta>
        지금 시작하기
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-4 text-mute text-xs">
      클릭하면 셋업 프롬프트가 클립보드에 복사됩니다
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
